    "About For you" : "Quant a Per a vós",
    "Aloha Social now learns which hashtags interest you from how you read, to build your For you feed. This stays on this server and is only visible to you." : "Ara Aloha Social aprèn quines etiquetes us interessen a partir de com llegiu, per construir el vostre canal Per a vós. Això es queda en aquest servidor i només ho veieu vós.",
