    "This decides what happens from now on. It does not take back a quote somebody has already posted — use the list below for that." : "Això decideix què passa d'ara endavant. No retira una cita que algú ja ha publicat: per a això, utilitzeu la llista de sota.",
    "Who has quoted it" : "Qui l'ha citada",
    "Nobody has quoted this post." : "Ningú no ha citat aquesta publicació.",
    "Detach this quote" : "Desvincula aquesta cita",
    "Detaching tells the other server, which then shows the quote as withdrawn. The post itself is theirs and stays where it is." : "Desvincular-la ho comunica a l'altre servidor, que llavors mostra la cita com a retirada. La publicació és seva i es queda on és.",
    "This quote is waiting for the quoted author to approve it." : "Aquesta cita espera que l'autor citat l'aprovi.",
